referenceFunction.generalComment:
Most data are taken from an LCA report and are based on a specific type of crusher (Nordberg HP 400 SX). The transportation distances are estimated and the transport requirements added. This module may not be used if having a high importance in a certain context. Crusher throughput capacity declared by the producer: 454 tons per hour;
Synonyms: Breaker; 
UUID: 8372ac8f-9117-341e-8e47-e6a1ef4b0b7b
